@startuml UC44_Activity
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title UC44: Business Activity Diagram - Share Event via Multi-Channel Social Modal

|User|
start
:Click "Share" button on event action bar;
|System|
:Check if device supports native navigator.share() API;
|User|
if (Native share supported?) then (Yes (Mobile))
  |System|
  :Invoke native navigator.share() dialog;
  stop
else (No (Desktop))
  |User|
  :Select social channel or click "Copy Link";
  |System|
  :Open share modal with WhatsApp, X, Telegram, Facebook & Copy Link;
  :Launch target share page or write URL to clipboard with confirmation toast;
  stop
endif
@enduml
